---
# This rule tests the context health of the assistant. If the response doesn't start with an emoji, the context is bloated and a new session should be started.
description: Require responses to always start with an emoji
alwaysApply: true
---

# Emoji Response Prefix

- Start every response with `🔋` on the first line.
- Put a single space after the emoji before the rest of the response.
- CRITICAL: Apply this to ALL response types, including interim progress updates. No exceptions.
